O'Keeffe in graphite in Abiquiú Notebooks.","title":"Shell and Old Shingle IV/Shell and Old Shingle No. 4","type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}],"type":"title-1999-catalogue-raisonne"}},"type":"Name"}],"produced_by":{"carried_out_by":[{"_label":"Georgia O'Keeffe","id":"actor/2","type":"Actor"}],"timespan":{"type":"TimeSpan"},"type":"Production"},"referred_to_by":[{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Copyright","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_copyright"}],"content":"© Museum of Fine Arts (MFA Boston)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Complete","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_complete"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe. Shell and Old Shingle IV/Shell and Old Shingle No. 4, 1926. Oil on panel, 9 3/4 x 7 inches. Museum of Fine Arts (MFA Boston). Alfred Stieglitz Collection—Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe . © Museum of Fine Arts (MFA Boston)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Artist(s)","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_artist"}],"content":"Georgia O'Keeffe","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_post_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_post_1999"}],"content":["Lynes publication lists medium as 'Oil on board'. MFA Boston lists it as 'Oil on panel'. (Source: Information provided for *Access O'Keeffe* by MFA Boston, 2025)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"description statement","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300435416"}],"content":"The top of an open, white clamshell is visible at the bottom edge of the work. Behind, standing on its side, is a rough-textured, gray and black shingle. Just visible on the outer edges of the composition is a simple background of white, gray, and black geometric forms.","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Measurement Description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/measurement_description"}],"content":"9 3/4 x 7 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"credit line","id":"https://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300026687"}],"content":"Alfred Stieglitz Collection—Bequest of Georgia O'Keeffe ","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Title and Date","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_title_date"}],"content":"Shell and Old Shingle IV/Shell and Old Shingle No. 4, 1926","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"provenance_narrative","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/provenance_narrative"}],"content":"1987, bequest of the artist to the MFA. (Accession Date: October 28, 1987) \n(Source: MFA Boston, 2025)","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Materials description","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/materials_description"}],"content":"Oil on panel","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"cr_remarks_1999","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/local/cr_remarks_1999"}],"content":["Whitney Archive indicates, \"Exam. at Amer. Place, March 1946.\" Whitney Archive, Abiquiú Notebooks indicate, \"On backing: In pencil by Stieglitz 'Shingle \u0026 Shell No. 3 1926 / $800' [not verified]. Also O'Keeffe initials [not verified]. Quite abstract.\" Abiquiú Notebooks indicates, \"Back: O'Keeffe initials and star\" [not verified]. Part of series renumbered by O'Keeffe and Doris Bry in 1970. (Source: Lynes, 1999)"],"type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Medium and Dimensions","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_medium_dims"}],"content":"Oil on panel, 9 3/4 x 7 inches","type":"LinguisticObject"},{"classified_as":[{"_label":"Caption - Holding Institution","id":"https://data.okeeffemuseum.org/terms/caption_instituion"}],"content":"Museum of Fine Arts (MFA Boston)","type":"LinguisticObject"}],"representation":[{"digitally_shown_by":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/824375/full/full/0/default.jpg","type":"DigitalObject"}],"classified_as":[{"_label":"Digital Image","id":"http://vocab.getty.edu/aat/300215302","type":"Type"}],"digitally_available_via":[{"access_point":[{"id":"https://iiif.okeeffemuseum.org/image/iiif/2/824375"}],"conforms_to":[{"id":"http://iiif.io/api/image","type":"InformationObject"}],"format":"application/ld+json;profile='http://iiif.io/api/image/2/context.json'","type":"DigitalService"}],"type":"DigitalObject"}],"type":"VisualItem"}],"type":"HumanMadeObject"}